---
// Characters 分类聚合页（CollectionPage）—— 方案 5.1
// 表格：名称 | 阵营 | 已知特长 | 解锁方式 | 确认状态
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import MediaFigure from '../../components/MediaFigure.astro';
import { SITE_IMAGES } from '../../data/images';
import Breadcrumb from '../../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import StatusBadge from '../../components/StatusBadge.astro';
import { MULTIPLAYER_RACERS, POD_LEGENDS, RACERS } from '../../data/characters';

const title = 'All Characters in Star Wars Galactic Racer — Roster & Unlocks';
const description =
  'Star Wars Galactic Racer characters: the campaign cast, the multiplayer rank roster, and the classic pod racers. Ranks are guide reports, not a store-page unlock list.';

const crumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
  { name: 'Characters', url: '/characters/' },
];
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} schemaType="collection" breadcrumb={crumbs}>
  <Breadcrumb items={crumbs} />

  <div class="mb-8 mt-4">
    <MediaFigure
      src={SITE_IMAGES.charactersArt.src}
      alt={SITE_IMAGES.charactersArt.alt}
      width={SITE_IMAGES.charactersArt.width}
      height={SITE_IMAGES.charactersArt.height}
      credit={SITE_IMAGES.charactersArt.credit}
    />
  </div>

  <header class="mt-4 max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-void-100 md:text-4xl">
      Star Wars Galactic Racer Characters
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-void-400">
      Shade is the campaign pilot. Hibi and Darius Pax live in the paddock. Kestar Bool is the
      champion. The rank table below is the multiplayer roster reported by player guides. Those
      ranks are not printed on the store page.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="mt-8 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-void-800">
    <table class="w-full border-collapse text-sm">
      <thead>
        <tr class="border-b border-void-700 bg-void-900/60 text-left text-void-400">
          <th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Racer</th>
          <th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Role</th>
          <th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Style</th>
          <th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Unlock</th>
          <th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Status</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {
          RACERS.map((r) => (
            <tr class="border-b border-void-800 align-top last:border-0 hover:bg-void-900/40">
              <td class="px-4 py-3">
                {r.image && (
                  <img src={r.image} alt="" width="180" height="225" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="mb-2 h-28 w-24 rounded object-cover object-top" />
                )}
                <div class="font-semibold text-void-100">
                  {r.hasDetailPage ? (
                    <a href={r.detailHref ?? `/characters/${r.slug}/`} class="text-plasma hover:underline">
                      {r.name}
                    </a>
                  ) : (
                    r.name
                  )}
                </div>
                <div class="mt-1 text-void-400">{r.summary}</div>
              </td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-void-400">{r.role}</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-void-300">{r.style ?? '—'}</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-void-400">{r.unlock}</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3">
                <StatusBadge status={r.source.status} size="sm" />
              </td>
            </tr>
          ))
        }
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold text-void-100">Multiplayer rank roster</h2>
  <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-void-400">
    Player guides agree on this order. Rank unlocks start at Rank 2. Shade is the default, not Rank 1.
    Ary Quill's style is Redliner. Goli's droid spelling is inconsistent between guides, so it is not listed as a second racer.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-void-800">
    <table class="w-full border-collapse text-sm">
      <thead>
        <tr class="border-b border-void-700 bg-void-900/60 text-left text-void-400">
          <th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Racer</th>
          <th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Style</th>
          <th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Reported unlock</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {
          MULTIPLAYER_RACERS.map((r) => (
            <tr class="border-b border-void-800 last:border-0">
              <td class="px-4 py-3">
                <div class="font-semibold text-void-100">{r.name}</div>
                <div class="mt-1 text-void-400">{r.summary}</div>
              </td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-void-300">{r.style}</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-void-400">{r.unlock}</td>
            </tr>
          ))
        }
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold text-void-100">Classic pod racers</h2>
  <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-void-400">
    These sit on the pod grid with Sebulba. They are not speeder-rank unlocks. Arcade pods are available from the menu. The campaign pod stretch is later.
  </p>
  <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
    {
      POD_LEGENDS.map((r) => (
        <li class="rounded-lg border border-void-800 bg-void-900/40 px-4 py-3">
          <div class="font-semibold text-void-100">{r.name}</div>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-void-400">{r.summary}</p>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ul>

  <p class="mt-6 text-void-400">
    Open a name for the role they actually play. Reaching Kestar is a tour, not a button:
    <a href="/tips/qualify-for-kestar/" class="text-plasma hover:underline">how qualification works</a>.
    The garage between scenes is the <a href="/tips/campaign-builds/" class="text-plasma hover:underline">build order</a>.
  </p>
</Layout>
